      "message": "The recorded digital TK3 target requires video execution."
    }
  ],
  "definitionGaps": [
    "Only tile drawing routes currently map to the artwork profile. Animation, programming, board authoring and gameplay capabilities require further quality/prerequisite refinement.",
    "The general artwork question probes existing bounded tile evidence; it does not prove compatibility with an undefined physical output.",
    "No duration-to-feasibility rule exists: a short-game intention or a couple of months cannot establish capacity, effort or a finish date.",
    "One capacity offer per person is supported. Multiple offers, dated origins and cross-project resource sharing need a later record extension.",
    "No enabling outputs are automatically available. Tool development remains candidate prerequisite work; #146 stays paused."
  ],
